.#-----------------------------------------------------
.input|markdown/1.2
.# Verify that tag matching is case-insensitive, that Markdown extensions (e.g. strikethrough) are supported inside
.# inline HTML, and that processing instructions and unclosed tags don't swallow the rest of the paragraph.
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<SPAN>~~a~~</span> **b** <?php x ?> *c* <span>d **e**
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|event/1.0
.#-----------------------------------------------------
beginDocument
beginParagraph
onMacroInline [html] [clean=false] [<SPAN><del>a</del></span>]
onSpace
beginFormat [BOLD]
onWord [b]
endFormat [BOLD]
onSpace
onMacroInline [html] [clean=false] [<?php x ?>]
onSpace
beginFormat [ITALIC]
onWord [c]
endFormat [ITALIC]
onSpace
onMacroInline [html] [clean=false] [<span>]
onWord [d]
onSpace
beginFormat [BOLD]
onWord [e]
endFormat [BOLD]
endParagraph
endDocument
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<SPAN><del>a</del></span> **b** <?php x ?> _c_ <span>d **e**
